WEBVTT

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.200
The Imber has begun to fly!

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:14.000
It is under the Idolmaster's control!

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.000
Hmph! What're they all worked up about?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.370
I'M the one who's good
at getting the job done!

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:26.330
What?

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.750
Emergency signal from the Nebula!

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.410
Target readings have increased to two!

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:31.660
Drops?

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.540
The Nebula has failed in its engagement.
The Drop has been split!

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:38.660
Send an emergency message to all
Mondenkind branches.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.790
Reclassify targets as Alpha and Beta
and confirm trajectory.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:44.700
Recalculate projected angles of entry.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.330
Hurry!

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.410
Me?

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:03.450
Yes. The Drop that Iori couldn't
destroy is headed your way.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:06.450
I-it's impossible! I still can't...

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.500
The Nebula can't make it
from its current location.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:10.750
But...

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:14.410
Right now, you're the only one
who can do anything.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:17.790
The only one...

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.830
S.O.S. kikoeta

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:25.790
Yatto anata ni kikoeta?

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:41.750
Kakko kawaiku ne

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:45.290
Fujun, junsui, dotchi no character?

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:48.120
Onaji na no kashira

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.660
Love beat ga sokudo zenkai

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:55.660
Kizuita, kore wa tokubetsu na mission... Wakatta

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:02.080
Honki misechau yo, kanaechau kara

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.950
Sora o tsukinuketa sekai de

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:12.910
Fushigi na omoi kanjita yo, shunkan de suki!

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.950
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:21.290
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:26.870
Naiteta chiisa na watashi ga tachimukau

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.200
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:32.500
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:40.580
Binetsu na kibun wa anata no sei kamo, S.O.S.!

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:55.500
Pot Stickers and Corndogs

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:54.200
The Nebula has destroyed Drop Alpha.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:58.120
Drop Beta will enter the Imber's
frame in 20 seconds.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.160
Drop Beta will enter
the frame in 10 seconds!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.250
Haruka?

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.910
Are you ready?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.750
Yes. Lesson 4, right?

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:15.200
The Imber has finished spotting.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.910
Five seconds to frame entry!

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.830
You're in my way! Move!

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.080
What?

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.790
Drop Beta has entered the frame!

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:27.290
It's no good, Iori! You won't
make it from your location!

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:32.040
I'm going to fix my own mistake.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.290
You get out of the way!

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.290
B-but...

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.750
Haruka, Iori won't make it.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.950
Two seconds to frame exit!

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.160
Haruka!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.660
Go!

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.080
I did it. I...

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.080
I did it!

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:26.250
Hurry up with those parts
stress measurements.

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.370
And don't forget to do a log backup.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:33.370
There's a LOT left to do.
Suzuna, fasten the top server.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.450
Okay.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:37.870
All right, I'm gonna check it out head to toe!

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.500
The chief is kinda perverted...

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:41.830
There...

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.250
Haruka!

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.330
Yukiho.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.620
That was incredible!

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:48.540
For you to do that your very first time...

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.040
I was moved!

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:55.160
It wasn't me. The Imber did all the work.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.290
Thank you for moving.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.500
What are you doing?

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.290
I said, what are you doing?

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.450
What am I doing?

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.870
You bust in on someone else's mission
and steal the credit...

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.870
You've got some nerve!

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.120
Stop this.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.790
Iori.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:23.370
Please come to the command room.
Haruka and Yukiho, you as well, please.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.750
Is this a storm I sense?

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.910
A shift change?

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:34.580
Makoto Kikuchi will be the
Nebula's master for the time being.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.330
Iori Minase, you're on standby.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:41.080
Haruka Amami, Yukiho Hagiwara, that is all.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:42.000
M-Ma'am.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:42.580
Why am I-?!

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:43.620
Iori.
Why am I-?!

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:46.000
Why did you make such
an elementary mistake?

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.950
Well...

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.410
It's because of Imber's idiot pilot!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.830
Because she's carrying on,
blathering in my ear!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.000
Come on!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.370
I wasn't "carrying on"!

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:02.200
Shut up! You sure talk back
a lot for a newbie!

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.290
Newbie?

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.870
That's enough.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.250
In any case, it's been decided.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.750
The three of you can go back
to quarters for today.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.870
Why is it MY fault?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.080
You think about unnecessary things.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:33.580
That's why you make mistakes.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.700
It's got nothing to do with you, does it?

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:52.290
It's no laughing matter!
This has really got me annoyed.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:56.080
You can't let her get to you.
That's the only way Forehead can talk.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.160
But...!

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.540
The truth is, she knows
it's her own mistake.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.870
I don't know...

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.500
Suzuna! Serika!
Can you handle the rest for me?

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.160
Sure.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.750
No problem.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:12.910
You're going to the dorm, right?

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.870
Yes. She said we can go home for the day.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:20.500
Well then, maybe we can all make dinner
together. To celebrate your debut.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:24.450
Really? So, can I invite Yayoi as well?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.660
Yes, but about what we do here...

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:27.790
It's a secret.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:30.750
Okay. So then, there'll be
five members in our group.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:37.830
Five? Me, Yukiho, Ritsuko, Yayoi...

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:50.540
Um, you came dressed like that again?

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:55.410
"Again"? I was a PENGUIN
last time, wasn't I?

00:07:55.450 --> 00:08:00.410
Izayoi
Dorm

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.870
Uh, that's not the issue...

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.200
Forget it!
Uh, that's not the issue...

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:06.450
Why? It's a pot sticker party!
It'll boost your stamina!

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:09.370
Shut up! I said I don't want any, didn't I?!

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:12.040
Why not let the country maiden eat them!

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.080
Huh, really? I guess I could, but...

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:17.450
You okay with that?

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:21.290
I might find that picture I happened
to take of you last New Years'

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.580
looking EXTREMELY unladylike and
"accidentally" distribute it on the Internet...

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:25.950
What's that?

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.330
I have plenty of copies.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.290
Okay, we'll be waiting in the dining room.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.790
One day... One day, I will crush you!

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:53.250
Things were bound
to turn out like this. Jeez.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.330
Okay!

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:59.700
Sure enough, they key to making
pot stickers is in the folds. The folds!

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.290
Uh, yeah!

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:01.950
Wait...

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.160
That's huge!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.080
Well, pot stickers are small
and kinda stingy, right?

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:09.500
If you're gonna eat a lot anyway,
you may as well make 'em big!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.290
M-maybe. Yukiho, what do you...?

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.910
Oh, already asleep, huh?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.790
Jeez, what are you so worked up about?

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.540
You're not a kid, are you?

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.290
What's with her?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.040
Don't worry. Pay her no mind.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.410
I can hear you.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:32.450
Still, how lucky for you that you actually
get happy over something like THIS.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.660
Oh, that's right. This is about the only thing
to look forward to in the sticks, huh?

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:37.540
Listen here!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.750
What's your problem?!

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:43.500
Your sitting there saying nothing
is so creepy I can't stand it!

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.200
Everyone's having fun making these,
so you should join in, shouldn't you?!

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:49.500
Yeah, right. Not with this
ribbon-wearing fool of a woman.

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:53.080
Who're you calling a fool?! That's my friend!

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:56.910
That's why she's so foolish. Idiot Ribbon
and the Cosplay Performer.

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:57.950
There's a nice duo.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.450
Idiot Ribbon?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.290
Good one.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.830
Anyway, this isn't cosplay;
it's a stuffed animal suit!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.790
Don't lump them together,
Forehead Sunshine!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.200
F-Forehead Sunshine?!

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.160
Good job.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.950
Don't laugh, Idiot Ribbon!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.000
Ooh, Forehead's mad.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.000
Don't call me Forehead!

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:28.200
Y-you squished my folds! Why you...!

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.580
Ow!

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:35.750
Eat this! My Gatling Beak of Rage!
You cannot even see it!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.500
Oh, shut up!

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:39.500
Forehead!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:41.870
Aah... That's hard.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.500
Yayoi!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.950
Okay, I've got more filling!

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:56.700
I'm home.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.370
Welcome back.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.700
How did it go? With Yayoi?

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.700
Well, I consoled her
and walked her to the station.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.580
Sounds tough. Should I make some tea?

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:09.830
Thank you. So, where's Forehead?

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:12.120
She's still in her room.

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:14.200
And Ribbon is still in the bath?

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:17.000
Yes. She said she can't get rid of the smell.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:23.620
Aah, jeez! Why does
this have to happen to me?

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.450
It still stinks.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.120
How long are you gonna be in here?

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.040
The smell won't go away!

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:38.370
Nobody cares about how YOU smell.

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.580
Now listen here, Minase, you-

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:44.620
I told you not to talk back didn't I, Newbie?!

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.830
The newbie was out of line.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:49.870
But for an "upperclassman,"
you make simple mistakes, huh?

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:52.330
Everyone said so.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:55.830
Such an elementary mistake is unthinkable!

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:56.830
Just like a rookie-

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:59.160
Stop talking like you know
what you're saying!

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:03.870
I wouldn't make that mistake because
I WANTED to, would I? That...!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:16.870
What's with her stuck-up attitude?
She just doesn't want to own up to it!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.410
Blegh at you!

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:22.080
Good morning!

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:29.080
Seriously! What did I do?
For her to talk all stuck-up!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.000
O-oh, really?

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.040
You know what else?!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:34.870
Ah!

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:38.200
Do I still smell like garlic?

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:40.580
No, not at all.

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:42.830
Really?

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.080
Yes.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:49.950
I know, right? I spent so long in the bath,
there's no way I could still smell like garlic.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.000
Yukiho! Why are you holding your breath?!

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:59.080
It's true. You don't smell at all, truly.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:01.500
Then why were you holding your...

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:06.290
Forward the damage data to Tsukimijima.

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:07.620
Regarding the heat-resistant armor...

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.040
Chikako!

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:09.750
Neutralization of the frame's residual
electric field is complete.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.870
What's going on here?
Neutralization of the frame's residual
electric field is complete.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:12.370
Ah. There was a sortie this mornin',
and Makoto went out.

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:15.620
Ah. There was a sortie this mornin',
and Makoto went out.
Begin non-destructive analysis in 30 minutes.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:15.870
Ah. There was a sortie this mornin',
and Makoto went out.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:19.370
Two Drops fell into the Cream Belt
at the same time.

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:24.160
We told her not to act rash
'cause we all got her back, but...

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:44.790
She's workin' from a rash position,
so it takes some major skills.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.910
Still, it's kinda forceful. I mean...

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.910
It really makes us mechanics cry.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:55.000
Nebula!

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.040
What?

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:11.200
Where do you get off?

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.370
About what?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.000
Don't "About what?" me!

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:17.500
Do you know what
you've put Nebula through?!

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.370
Sure enough, Minase...

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:22.080
You still think about unnecessary things.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:26.160
The iDOLs are machines.
They don't feel pain.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.750
They don't think they've been
"put through" anything.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:33.250
But they're not just machines!
The iDOLs have minds-

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:34.370
Then...

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:38.040
Keep making mistakes.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:42.000
For the iDOLs you love so much.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.410
You were listening?

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.120
I'm sorry.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.830
I think so, too.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:03.540
That the iDOLs have minds. I think so.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:24.500
This is...

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.580
Forehead's data from yesterday?

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.870
Yes. It's kind of bothering me.

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:31.410
Huh? Ritsuko?

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.040
What's bothering you?

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.870
Uh, well, everything looks fine
until halfway through, but...

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.250
Here.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:43.040
It's so sudden, maybe there's
some other cause...

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:44.580
Debris, huh?

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:48.870
She avoided debris that would've
struck the Nebula's foot.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:52.330
She tried to protect the iDOL from debris.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:55.160
A lot of times, the iDOLs
have to sustain damage

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.540
to increase the accuracy of the mission.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:03.410
But she's tried hard to use her skills
to cover for that. This time, too, I bet.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.250
Ritsuko told me.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.160
Why did you keep quiet?

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:12.580
That you were trying to protect Nebula.

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.450
A mistake is a mistake, right?

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.290
But...!

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:19.330
The iDOLs exist to protect
humans from Drops.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.370
If you make a mistake trying
to protect an iDOL,

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:22.660
your priorities are backwards, right?

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.580
Yes, but, Nebula-
your priorities are backwards, right?

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.830
I know!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:32.200
That's why I have to get stronger.
Strong enough to protect them all.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:36.410
I'll help you!

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.200
There's something you have
to do first, isn't there?

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.660
Nebula wasn't the one you rode.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:51.910
Jeez. She's an idiot AND clueless.

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.500
Thank you!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.620
Idiot Ribbon.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:07.910
That's right. I've said it's all because of you,
Imber, but I haven't thanked you.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.910
Sorry, okay?

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.080
There.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:57.620
I feel refreshed!

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.290
And now the smell's surely...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.870
Haruka!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.410
Ah, Yukiho!

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:04.450
See? The smell's all-

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.750
Now's not the time.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.120
This is big!

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.290
A mock battle?

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:17.790
Yes. Iori asked Kikuchi for a duel.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:22.910
The boss is taking them to the
training room's simulator right now.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:29.500
Iori!

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.750
Minase and... Kikuchi...!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.450
It's already over.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.950
Did you think you could win?

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:55.250
Someone like YOU, who's always
thinking of unnecessary things?

00:18:56.330 --> 00:19:01.830
That's why I have to get stronger.
Strong enough to protect them all.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.870
Leave all the data as-is.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:06.750
Ma'am.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:08.830
Me, too.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.120
Please let me fight, too!

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:19.000
I want to protect them, too.
Nebula, and the other iDOLs!

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:22.910
Makoto. Well?

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.580
Fine.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.450
I have no objection.

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:41.000
She fought Makoto for
5 minutes, 43 seconds.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:43.910
Plenty good for a beginner.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.500
Yes.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.750
What are you doing?

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:08.290
Nothing.

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.700
I'm sorry.

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:15.750
Not only did I butt in, I lost.

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:19.040
Makoto has been training
here since she was born.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:21.330
You couldn't have won, could you?

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.120
Oh...

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.410
You piss me off.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.620
Huh?

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:32.580
I said, you piss me off!
Why are YOU depressed?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.750
You selfishly barged in
and you selfishly lost, right?

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:36.950
Yes, but...

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:41.790
That's the definition of butting in!
You ask me, someone like you is...

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:44.580
What's that?

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.330
Is that maybe for...

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:52.870
No! I just happened to forgot
I'd bought it, that's all!

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:55.120
If you want it, eat it.

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:56.330
Um, but...

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:57.540
Just do it!

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.370
Thank you.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:01.660
See you.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.370
Iori!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.290
Ih'ff deliffiss!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:20.080
Thanks very much! It's delicious, Iori!

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:24.750
What kind of face is that?

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:29.410
That's the first time I've seen you laugh!

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:31.250
You're so cute!

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:32.750
What are you talking about?

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:33.750
Come on, show me again!

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:34.450
Y-you idiot!

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:35.250
Haruka!

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.580
Ah, Yukiho! Iori just-

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:40.410
What's going on?

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:43.660
Yukiho, do you have a camera?
Just now, Iori-

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:46.700
Idiot! You really are Idiot Ribbon!

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:48.790
Come on. Stop that already, Forehead.

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.250
What? Forehead?!

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:51.910
Seems like you're having fun.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:52.410
Yeah.
Seems like you're having fun.

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.660
It's not fun at all!

00:21:56.330 --> 00:22:05.250
Toki o wataru seija no you ni

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:14.250
Donna kodoku ni naite ita no?

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:23.120
Haruka tooi hoshi o tsunagi

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:31.660
Ne, omoi o egaku wa, sora o miagete

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:43.080
Dear boy, itsumo kokoro ni anata o sagaseba

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:52.080
Ah, dakishimeru hodo ni tsuyoi hikari o hanatsu no

00:22:52.080 --> 00:23:01.000
Mabataku kidou ga futari no mejirushi

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:12.620
Ima doko de mite ite mo truth kanjitete

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:41.040
Preview
Cold Hands, Warm Hands

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:29.200
Azusa, you sure are incredible!

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:30.290
Oh, really?

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:36.080
Yes! You're adult, driven,
look after others, and sort of...

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:37.410
Sort of?

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:40.120
Like an aunt.
